        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 12
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 8521,
        "name": "纺月的夜歌",
        "desc": "<p>纯净无垢的花朵，传说是因冰风而保持了永恒的美丽。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2025/09/01/b8350998129a66e67c1a7691153da68d_6559589601591776539.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 5
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7572,
        "name": "深廊终曲",
        "desc": "<p>由北国的玉石打造而成的冰之花，花瓣已然在漫长的岁月中湮落成尘。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2025/03/17/bf39402f87db1168263c7c0898c8ab0c_4434336707917443666.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 5
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 9151,
        "name": "晨星与月的晓歌",
        "desc": "<p>古时为空月女神塑像的工匠，为彰显神明华美的容姿而精心雕琢的花饰。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2026/01/12/ef58ecfcb8906792c3a9b07c92586934_3343384077195352394.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 5
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 3321,
        "name": "乐园遗落之花",
        "desc": "",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2022/12/07/36540823/50ce09dfa5a91a33aa9cedfb15bcf2d1_5811563607794186888.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 5
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7785,
        "name": "苍耀",
        "desc": "原本如同拂晓的白星般纯净的无垢之刃，如今已被染上幽蓝的黯色。",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2025/06/12/0809293ee527b40073c4c9636eff6dd0_2992571952915882222.png",
